  "repo_truth": "The original P3B selector was independently CLEAN, but its first focused preview still refused because the recursively copied pipeline fixture stage declares only the old FEATURE_SPEC.md output. Both fixture roots have three stale Stage 10 core assets and currently untracked, byte-identical candidate repository-profile files selecting only Work Specification over shipped-root 1.2. The partial cli_surface delta changes only Stage 10 proof setup/assertions. No fixture authority input or production file has been edited after the refusal.",
  "allowed_scope": [
    "Read-only replay of all 24 manifest entries and the exact selector-repair diff.",
    "Trace both CLI fixture installers to recursive fixture-root copy behavior.",
    "Verify the refusal is caused by stale committed fixture authority, not production.",
    "Validate that the ten additive fixture paths are sufficient and minimal for clean-checkout Stage 10 compile/capture proof.",
    "Validate byte-identity requirements for the six core mirrors and two fixture-profile pairs.",
    "Inspect the candidate fixture profile/selection semantics and ensure they select only Work Specification over shipped-root 1.2.",
    "Apply the 04 reviewability indicators and identify findings independently before comparing P3/P4 candidates with 09."
  ],
  "non_goals": [
    "No edits, formatting, staging, commit, push, handoff, ledger, dispatch, or delegation.",
    "No production/runtime, released profile/schema/definition, public API, dependency, Cargo/version, unsafe-policy, support helper, generated output, P2, P4, P5, P6, or sibling-slice change.",
    "Do not treat current untracked fixture profile files as committed clean-checkout proof."
  ],
  "tasks": [
    "Verify complete subject identity and inspect the exact selector-repair delta.",
    "Reproduce or trace the focused preview refusal through recursive fixture copy and stale output declarations.",
    "Determine whether all ten additive fixture paths are necessary and whether any unlisted path is required.",
    "Validate the candidate repository profile/selection exactness, cross-fixture byte identity, and absence of runtime widening.",
    "Return findings first in Critical, Required, Optional, Nit order with exact file/line, violated contract, why wrong, smallest remediation, and missing verification."
  ],
  "contracts_and_gates": [
    "P3 canonical Work Specification YAML and generated Markdown-view authority remain unchanged",
    "CLI fixture roots must reproduce P3 from a clean checkout",
    "Only the exact ten additive fixture-authority paths may be synchronized",
    "Generated fixture-repo outputs remain transient and uncommitted",
    "No production symbol, support helper, or broader schema inference is authorized"
  ],
  "stop_conditions": [
    "Return blocked if subject identity or required read-only evidence cannot be established.",
    "Report rather than repair any finding.",
    "Do not edit, delegate, create another dispatch, write a handoff, modify the ledger, stage, commit, or push."
  ],
